            "quote": "We found Vivid Lighting via a web search as we needed a complex design produced very quickly. Exhausting our regular supplier list, we were really struggling to find a company that could turn around a bespoke design in the two week lead time we had. Vivid hold a lot of off-the-shelf kit so could deliver within our allotted timeframe, to the quality we expected and required. They had elements powder-coated to fit the brief and their standard of work throughout was excellent, as was their communication and professionalism. I can't recommend the team at Vivid enough and we will be using them again in the future. It's been great working with Lee, Rupert and the wider team.",
